  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Symposium - Egypt Forward Technical Workshop, through MFM Lamey Group, LLC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Egypt Forward Technical Workshops foster the participation of U.S. companies in the implementation of agribusiness, energy, ICT, and transportation projects in Egypt by exposing key stakeholders from these sectors to state-of-the-art U.S. technologies, equipment, and services, as well as policies, regulations, and financing mechanisms that can support the implementation of infrastructure and development projects in Egypt.</narrative>
  </description>
